    "data": "<h1 style=\"margin: 16px 0; font-size: 26px !important;\">Biliboard术力口周榜</h1><p>创刊于2024年6月12日，继承自日本Billboard周榜，收录包括但不限于使用VOCALOID、UTAU、SynthesizerV、CEVIO、初音ミクNT等音声合成引擎制作的歌曲（统称“术曲”），旨在针对B站的流行趋势对术曲排名，并传播日本虚拟歌姬文化。</p><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img class=\"cut-off-6\" alt=\"cut-off-6\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/article/02db465212d3c374a43c60fa2625cc1caeaab796.png\"/></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">排名计算方式</h1><p>0、数据统计周期为上周周二12点至本周周二12点</p><p>1、时间修正</p><p>t = LOG(EXP(DATE([投稿日期])-DATE([最近一期周榜的发布时间的前一天]))/14 + 1)+1</p><p>2、得分计算</p><p>播放基数 = 新增播放 * 时间修正</p><p>得分 = 播放基数 + 新增收藏 * 30 + 新增点赞 * 3 + 新增硬币 * 10 + (投票比值 + 100%) * 播放基数</p><p>投票&amp;提名网站: <a href=\"https://aquarite.uk\">https://aquarite.uk</a></p><p>排名并不完全等同于歌曲质量，请理性看待！</p><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img class=\"cut-off-5\" alt=\"cut-off-5\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/article/4adb9255ada5b97061e610b682b8636764fe50ed.png\"/></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 20 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ZcKdzDE5Q/\" target=\"_blank\">捉迷藏</a></h1><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/bf52f06cae3e58c1e88ebe8a589f830beb4fab8b.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"false\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 19 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1XeYGzWEsk/\" target=\"_blank\">没救了的厨艺节目</a></h1><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/97469fe982e17da2b85912959fd31ed0c3825752.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"false\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 18 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1k6YPz7EaW/\" target=\"_blank\">红丝绒起义</a></h1><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/be194fa6e0a68665ceabd17f71d484baca19c2f7.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"false\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 17 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1hs411W7uR/\" target=\"_blank\">妄想感伤代偿联盟</a></h1><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/5dedb17c6dd8c7cd35b3c34ebe24c269efbb50f0.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"false\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 16 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1deYNzgEtQ/\" target=\"_blank\">重音teto到底能不能和miku一起逃离这场派对呢</a></h1><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/5cf95433a14bc80ebb4ed433c6e96e5c35ef6786.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"false\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 15 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1FjxHzGEbv/\" target=\"_blank\">绝望行军</a></h1><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/aa1da2b81b814d40a31788297b178ea042f8e213.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"false\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 14 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV15J4m1A7qy/\" target=\"_blank\">催眠师</a></h1><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/c4496e1c95132a8dd859f9ad52d92a7e58efec75.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"false\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 13 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Jsu3zMEpY/\" target=\"_blank\">樱桃汽水</a></h1><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/2c9c215044fdafa1d4cbb259cda10bb44040314d.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"false\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 12 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1VybNzfECt/\" target=\"_blank\">选哪个</a></h1><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/4e041751f24920c82921791205f1ac1b64e1a4f3.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"false\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 11 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV148tzzVEoK/\" target=\"_blank\">小小的我</a></h1><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/3b997ab76b99a71344a6f596b7feabd11b1246c8.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"false\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 10 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1phhHz8EPF/\" target=\"_blank\">即刻轮回</a></h1><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/7ef814b3a46b4555d1e3aec905bb622e4d4521ac.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"false\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 9 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ucGzzuEhw/\" target=\"_blank\">胭脂</a></h1><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/47d88096db4772e08281e078bc9f77f73c4d694f.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"false\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 8 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1qDUPYKEzf/\" target=\"_blank\">视奸</a></h1><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/cb57a835ced66703577b203f8dff9075dc2bc95b.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"false\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 7 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1njnFzNEwp/\" target=\"_blank\">若能成为谁的心脏</a></h1><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/96904b56ae0263b3dc950db8fb0b2cfcfceb4c68.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"false\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 6 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1DFhmz2Ehn/\" target=\"_blank\">Doomer</a></h1><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/7f65f1813d0d3a0bbd874ff974c1a8d5ed7f8b89.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"false\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 5 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1YLxszzETc/\" target=\"_blank\">明明昨天就应该死去</a></h1><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/9b9e7e5290ce52683f6029fa3a49a83b73868184.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"false\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 4 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1SfK9zPEL3/\" target=\"_blank\">不要听那姓T的话</a></h1><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/e3e43ede3d0d379f294a3bfc4a8730e07047da8b.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"false\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 3 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1JThqzwEGq/\" target=\"_blank\">誓见“好朋友”</a></h1><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/90aa2fb1a20f53fb8d5616